sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Order groceries online
    %% Stories: 32, 37, 38, 39, 40
    %% Description: A customer purchases products online, reuses previous orders from the order history and pays digitally.
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant CU as Customer
    participant OD as Order
    participant PR as Product
    participant PY as Payment

    %% covers 32
    CP->>CU: purchase products online
    CU->>OD: new order
    OD->>PR: ordered products
    %% covers 37
    CP->>CU: view order history
    %% covers 38, 39
    CP->>CU: reorder or reuse products of a previous order
    %% covers 40
    CP->>CU: pay digitally
    CU->>OD: order to pay
    OD->>PY: payment
